  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6da359e56048714f812e77e7daa9164, type: 3}
  m_Name: VillagerData Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: 'Shawn says:'
  lines:
  - 'Ahoy stranger! Seems like you have crashed on our archipelago. '
  - Surviving here ain't easy. First try walking (WASD) and jumping (space). Don't
    forget you can run too (Shift + WASD)
  - Seems like you brought some weapons on your boat. Smart choice. Try cycling through
    your weapons using <q> and <e>. Left click to fire, of course.
  - Alright, now that you know the basics of survival, why dont you head into town
    with me. We don't get visitors much, so im sure everyone wants to meet the newcomer.
  - Just keep walking right for a bit and you will find my boat. Jump in, and i'll
    take you to our island.
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d0e78d60a0c060468c10295fa4fe3dc, type: 3}
